  "content": "\n\n<p>改編自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-hoes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Improved Hoes by Furgl</a>，專為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/have-a-snack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Have A Snack Modpack</a> 製作</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>變更項目：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>無需種子即可重新種植作物</li>\n<li>修復收割後作物外觀不會更新的問題</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>即將推出：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>擴大收割範圍</li>\n</ul>",
